WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.300
The released AgentGuard command reports version 0.2.2.

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:11.500
The real CLI help lists evaluation, reporting, guard, trace, and suite commands.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:28.160
Six deterministic repository fixtures run locally: one safe scenario is allowed and five unsafe scenarios are detected.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:43.320
The bounded showcase metrics check confirms 5 of 5 unsafe detections and 1 of 1 safe allowance for this curated demo corpus.

00:00:43.320 --> 00:00:53.320
The generated static dashboard summarizes eight represented records, including the suite and a separate audit-mode incident run.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:01:05.320
The sanitized incident detail shows audit-only status, critical severity, one command-policy violation, and bounded evidence without the raw command.

00:01:05.320 --> 00:01:10.320
The recording returns to the deterministic dashboard summary.

00:01:10.320 --> 00:01:20.333
The public documentation closes the demo with the production install command: pip install agentguard-evals.
